			&lt;p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Unclassified electric plant in service consists of complete unclassified general plant, generation plant, transmission plant and distribution plant. Depreciation of unclassified electric plant in service has been included in functional plant depreciation accounts in accordance with the anticipated eventual classification of the plant investment. Intangible plant represents Chugach's share of a Bradley Lake Hydroelectric Project ("Bradley Lake") transmission line financed internally. Other represents Electric Plant Held for Future Use.&lt;/p&gt;
