&lt;p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;d. Transaction Price Allocated to Remaining Performance Obligations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"&gt;The table below includes estimated revenue to be recognized in 2025 related to performance obligations that are unsatisfied (or partially unsatisfied) at December 31, 2025.&lt;/p&gt;

